      "message": "@mmaurer@google.com I had to revert to using a patch for `libflatbuffers`. Without it, `cargo_embargo` finds the `license \u003d \"Apache-2.0\"` in `Cargo.toml` and overwrites the edited `package`/`license` in Android.bp with its own ones. The generated ones refer to a `LICENSE` file that doesn\u0027t exist in this directory, and the build fails.\n\nThere is one 2 directories above, in `external/flatbuffers`. But I can\u0027t refer to it by relative path, because Soong doesn\u0027t allow references outside the package directory.\n\nIs there a better way? A `LICENSE` symlink could work I guess?",
      "parentUuid": "7eb27c1f_aed8909d",
